      "content": "everything is just... gone, Elara. the kingdom, the people... even the reason i woke up this morning. i look at my hands and i don't even recognize the person they belong to anymore. there's nothing left to protect. there's nothing left to fight for. it's just a hollow, endless cold. i don't think i can keep walking this path.",
